close_reason: "Delivered cross-call context-session budgeting and repeat suppression as universal SDK/CLI primitives. Versioned caller-carried state, strict validation, cumulative whole-envelope receipts, deterministic exhaustion, resolvable references, full transport/schema/completion exposure, and a shrink-only two-tier orientation ratchet are verified with exact coverage and temporary-workspace acceptance."
body: ""
